<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1519] AM/PM of dates are ignored when reading note.json</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1519</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Dates of saved notes are all AM except for newly executed paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think AM/PM information are ignored when reading notes from storage.&lt;br/&gt;
So if notes are written back to storage, all dates are AM.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;NotebookImportDeserializer may be the cause.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
